  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1640.02 Separation Distances of Ammonium Nitrate and Blasting Agents. Table 1640.2, cited below, shall set forth recommended separation distances of ammonium nitrate and blasting agents from explosives or blasting agents:\n\nTable 1640.2 Distances of Ammonium Nitrate and Blasting Agents\n\nPounds Over | Donor Weight Pounds Not Over | Ammonium Nitrate/Blasting Agent | Minimum Separation Distance of Receptor When Barricaded (ft) | Minimum Thickness of Artificial Barricade (in.)\n\n0 | 100 | 3 | 11 | 12\n\n100 | 300 | 4 | 14 | 12\n\n300 | 600 | 5 | 18 | 12\n\n600 | 1,000 | 6 | 22 | 12\n\n1,000 | 1,600 | 7 | 25 | 12\n\n1,600 | 2,000 | 8 | 29 | 12\n\n2,000 | 3,000 | 9 | 32 | 15\n\n3,000 | 4,000 | 10 | 36 | 15\n\n4,000 | 6,000 | 11 | 40 | 15\n\n6,000 | 8,000 | 12 | 43 | 20\n\n8,000 | 10,000 | 13 | 47 | 20\n\n10,000 | 12,000 | 14 | 50 | 20\n\n12,000 | 16,000 | 15 | 54 | 25\n\n16,000 | 20,000 | 16 | 58 | 25\n\n20,000 | 25,000 | 18 | 65 | 25\n\n25,000 | 30,000 | 19 | 68 | 30\n\n30,000 | 35,000 | 20 | 72 | 30\n\n35,000 | 40,000 | 21 | 76 | 30\n\n40,000 | 45,000 | 22 | 79 | 35\n\n45,000 | 50,000 | 23 | 83 | 35\n\n50,000 | 55,000 | 24 | 86 | 35\n\n55,000 | 60,000 | 25 | 90 | 35\n\n60,000 | 70,000 | 26 | 94 | 40\n\n70,000 | 80,000 | 28 | 101 | 40\n\n80,000 | 90,000 | 30 | 108 | 40\n\n90,000 | 100,000 | 32 | 115 | 40\n\n100,000 | 120,000 | 34 | 122 | 50\n\n120,000 | 140,000 | 37 | 133 | 50\n\n140,000 | 160,000 | 40 | 144 | 50\n\n160,000 | 180,000 | 44 | 158 | 50\n\n180,000 | 200,000 | 48 | 173 | 50\n\n200,000 | 220,000 | 52 | 187 | 60\n\n220,000 | 250,000 | 56 | 202 | 60\n\n250,000 | 275,000 | 60 | 216 | 60\n\n275,000 | 300,000 | 64 | 230 | 60\n\nSource. #4584, eff 3-3-89; ss by #5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95; ss and moved by #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03 (formerly Saf-C 1666.02)\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
